  "title": "Information transmission with quantum squeezed light",
  "summary": "<ul> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Squeezed quantum states deliberately reduce noise below classical limits by redistributing it in accordance with Heisenberg&rsquo;s uncertainty principle.</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\">This packs far more distinguishable signal levels into optical interconnects than any classical modulation</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> allo</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ws, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">directly boosting capacity</span></li> </ul>",
